{
  "_about": "Synthetic schema.org Event JSON-LD for the frozen world (target Saturday 2026-11-07, Asia/Kolkata). Each scenario is run through the same JSON-LD extractor as live web events (app.providers.events_web.event_to_candidate). URLs use the reserved example.com domain. Venue names may be real places; the events themselves are invented. Descriptions exist only to prove they are never read.",
  "version": 1,
